/text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"model\" transform=\"translate(440 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">逻辑回归分类</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">训练160窗冻结系数</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"baseline\" transform=\"translate(440 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f4efe4\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">RMS单阈值</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">对照总体振动幅度</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-node=\"gate\" data-flow-step=\"2\"><polygon points=\"735,20 800,65 735,110 670,65\" fill=\"#fbf0d9\"/><text x=\"735\" y=\"71\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">输入与场景是否对应？差异需要人工复核吗？</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"review\" transform=\"translate(670 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f6eade\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">频谱定位</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">区分5Hz与25Hz成分</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"output\" transform=\"translate(880 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">状态与错误计数</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">误报漏报与F1</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"compare\" transform=\"translate(880 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">独立窗口推断</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">90窗同一评价分母</text></g>\n </svg></div><figcaption>详细原理、数据图表与计算见下方各步骤。<span data-flow-instruction></span></figcaption></figure><article class=\"workflow-step flow-step\" data-step=\"0\"><h3>1. 计算振动特征</h3><p>独立设备片段计算RMS、频带比和峰值因子。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 95\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"计算振动特征的输入动作与产物\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"16\" width=\"250\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e7efea\"/><path d=\"M270 43H340l-10-7m10 7l-10 7\" stroke=\"#14796f\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"352\" y=\"16\" width=\"398\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f7f1e6\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#243740\">计算振动特征</text><text x=\"369\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#243740\">160个带标签训练窗</text></svg><p><b>产物：</b>160个带标签训练窗</p><p class=\"sub\">注意：频率定义与采样率一起记录。</p></article><article class=\"workflow-step flow-step\" data-step=\"1\"><h3>2. 拟合二分类器</h3><p>在训练窗上拟合带正则逻辑回归。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 95\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"拟合二分类器的输入动作与产物\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"16\" width=\"250\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e7efea\"/><path d=\"M270 43H340l-10-7m10 7l-10 7\" stroke=\"#14796f\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"352\" y=\"16\" width=\"398\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f7f1e6\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#243740\">拟合二分类器</text><text x=\"369\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#243740\">冻结特征系数</text></svg><p><b>产物：</b>冻结特征系数</p><p class=\"sub\">注意：输出分数未经概率校准。</p></article><article class=\"workflow-step flow-step\" data-step=\"2\"><h3>3. 查看频谱并评价</h3><p>对90个独立测试窗推断，切换窗口定位频带。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 95\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"查看频谱并评价的输入动作与产物\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"16\" width=\"250\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e7efea\"/><path d=\"M270 43H340l-10-7m10 7l-10 7\" stroke=\"#14796f\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"352\" y=\"16\" width=\"398\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f7f1e6\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#243740\">查看频谱并评价</text><text x=\"369\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#243740\">F1、漏报与误报</text></svg><p><b>产物：</b>F1、漏报与误报</p><p class=\"sub\">注意：标签只用于末端评分。</p></article>"
